 compliance", "reason": "How effective are different age assurance technologies at enforcing social media age restrictions?"},{"unit_ids": ["Dd1a044c3ed.P065.S001"], "anchor": "from September this year, every pupil across England will learn about social media in the classroom, including about AI and how to spot deepfakes", "reason": "Does mandatory classroom digital-literacy education change pupils' online behaviour and safety outcomes?"},{"unit_ids": ["Dd1a044c3ed.P069.S001"], "anchor": null, "reason": "Does expanding after-school enrichment activities improve outcomes for children who reduce social media use?"},{"unit_ids": ["Dd1a044c3ed.P071.S001"], "anchor": "we are investing £500m in our National Youth Strategy", "reason": "Does public investment in youth services and arts improve wellbeing and outcomes for children across socioeconomic groups?"}]}
